---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import StatusDisclaimer from '../components/StatusDisclaimer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Blipfoto status (unofficial) · b-oss"
  description="An independent, unofficial check of whether the Blipfoto website and API are working, with history. Not run by Blipfoto."
  nav="status"
>
  <a slot="top" class="skip-link" href="#uptime">Skip the charts and go to the uptime table and incident list</a>

  <StatusDisclaimer slot="below-header" />

  <div class="status-page">
    <header class="st-head">
      <p class="st-eyebrow">Status</p>
      <h1>Is Blipfoto working?</h1>
      <p class="st-sub-lead">
        An independent check of the Blipfoto website and API. <a href="how-this-works.html">How this works</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="st-card" aria-labelledby="st-now-title" data-now>
      <noscript>
        <p class="st-loading">
          This page needs JavaScript to show live status. Without it, the unofficial notice above and
          the explanation below still apply.
        </p>
      </noscript>
    </section>

    <section class="st-section" aria-labelledby="st-48-title">
      <h2 id="st-48-title">Last 48 hours</h2>
      <p class="st-sub">An empty lane means no problems.</p>
      <ul class="st-legend" aria-label="Key">
        <li><span class="st-key st-key-down"></span><strong>Down</strong> our checks found a problem</li>
        <li><span class="st-key st-key-nodata"></span><strong>No data</strong> we couldn’t check</li>
        <li><span class="st-key st-key-shared"></span><strong>Shared</strong> people shared a problem; not verified</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="st-sub st-collecting" data-collecting></p>
      <div data-lanes></div>
    </section>

    <section class="st-section" aria-labelledby="st-hist-title">
      <div class="st-hist-title">
        <div>
          <h2 id="st-hist-title">History</h2>
          <p class="st-sub">Time down each day. Empty means no problems.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="st-ranges" role="group" aria-label="Time range" data-ranges></div>
      </div>
      <div data-history></div>
    </section>

    <section class="st-section" id="uptime" aria-labelledby="st-uptime-title">
      <h2 id="st-uptime-title">Uptime</h2>
      <p class="st-sub">How much of the time each part was working.</p>
      <div data-uptime></div>
    </section>

    <section class="st-section" id="incidents" aria-labelledby="st-inc-title">
      <h2 id="st-inc-title">Incidents</h2>
      <p class="st-sub">Problems our checks found, newest first.</p>
      <div data-incidents></div>
    </section>

    <section class="st-section" id="how-measured" aria-labelledby="st-how-title">
      <h2 id="st-how-title">How this is measured</h2>
      <details class="st-details">
        <summary>What the checks do, and what they can’t tell you</summary>
        <ul>
          <li>We check every 15 minutes, from one place outside Blipfoto’s own network.</li>
          <li>
            <strong>Site</strong> is the blipfoto.com website in a web browser; <strong>API</strong> is what
            apps such as b-ark and b-mobile use. If photos don’t load, both show as down.
          </li>
          <li>
            A problem shorter than 15 minutes may not show at all, and start times and durations are
            approximate, to the nearest 15 minutes.
          </li>
          <li>
            Times of day are UK time. History days, and the uptime figures, count each day from midnight to
            midnight UTC.
          </li>
          <li>
            Uptime is the share of checked time that each part worked, rounded down. Periods when we
            couldn’t check are left out, so they count neither for nor against.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p><a href="how-this-works.html">Read the full explanation: how this works</a></p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="st-section" id="share" aria-labelledby="st-share-title">
      <h2 id="st-share-title">Share a problem</h2>
      <p class="st-sub">
        Something not working for you? Share it so other Blipfoto users can see they’re not alone. Shared
        problems are anonymous and not verified.
      </p>
      <div class="st-share-grid">
        <div class="st-form-card" data-share hidden>
          <form novalidate>
            <div data-error class="st-form-error" role="alert" hidden>
              <strong>That didn’t work.</strong> Nothing was shared. Please try again.
            </div>
            <div data-fields>
              <fieldset class="st-fieldset">
                <legend class="st-legend-q">What are you using?</legend>
                <div class="st-options">
                  <label class="st-option">
                    <input type="radio" name="using" value="website" />
                    <span><strong>The website</strong><span class="st-sub">blipfoto.com in a browser</span></span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="st-option">
                    <input type="radio" name="using" value="app" />
                    <span><strong>An app</strong><span class="st-sub">b-ark, b-mobile or another app</span></span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </fieldset>
              <fieldset class="st-fieldset">
                <legend class="st-legend-q">What’s happening?</legend>
                <div class="st-options">
                  <label class="st-option">
                    <input type="radio" name="what" value="offline" />
                    <span><strong>It’s offline</strong><span class="st-sub">Won’t load at all, or can’t connect.</span></span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="st-option">
                    <input type="radio" name="what" value="degraded" />
                    <span><strong>It’s not working right</strong><span class="st-sub">It loads, but something isn’t right.</span></span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </fieldset>
              <fieldset class="st-fieldset">
                <legend class="st-legend-q">Anything specific? <span class="st-sub">Optional</span></legend>
                <div class="st-chips">
                  <label class="st-chip-opt"><input type="checkbox" name="tag" value="login" /><span>Login</span></label>
                  <label class="st-chip-opt"><input type="checkbox" name="tag" value="uploads" /><span>Uploads</span></label>
                  <label class="st-chip-opt"><input type="checkbox" name="tag" value="slow" /><span>Slow</span></label>
                  <label class="st-chip-opt"><input type="checkbox" name="tag" value="unreliable" /><span>Unreliable</span></label>
                </div>
              </fieldset>
              <div class="st-fieldset">
                <p class="st-legend-q">Quick check that you’re a person</p>
                <div class="st-turnstile" data-turnstile>
                  Anti-bot check (Cloudflare Turnstile widget goes here)
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="st-share-actions">
              <button type="submit" class="st-btn st-btn-primary" data-submit disabled>Share</button>
              <p class="st-share-note">
                Shared with other users on this page. It does not go to Blipfoto. To get help,
                <a href="#">contact Blipfoto Support</a>.
              </p>
            </div>
            <p class="st-sub" data-hint>Choose what you’re using and what’s happening, then share.</p>
            <p class="st-privacy">
              No account needed. We keep your answers and the time. To limit repeat shares, an anonymous
              marker is kept for about half an hour, then deleted.
            </p>
          </form>
          <div class="st-already" data-already hidden>
            <h3 tabindex="-1">You’ve shared a problem recently</h3>
            <p>Thanks, it still counts.</p>
            <p class="st-share-note">
              Shared problems don’t go to Blipfoto. To get help, <a href="#">contact Blipfoto Support</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="st-thanks" data-thanks role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="st-thanks-title" hidden>
            <div class="st-thanks-card">
              <span class="st-icon st-icon-up" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
              <h3 id="st-thanks-title" tabindex="-1">Thank you for sharing</h3>
              <p>
                Thank you for sharing your observation with the community. Please let Blipfoto Support know
                about your problem so they have the chance to fix it.
              </p>
              <div class="st-thanks-actions">
                <a class="st-btn st-btn-primary" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contact Blipfoto Support ↗</a>
                <button type="button" class="st-btn" data-done>Done</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <noscript><p class="st-sub">Sharing a problem needs JavaScript.</p></noscript>
        </div>
        <aside class="st-help">
          <h3>Need help from Blipfoto?</h3>
          <p>
            Problems shared here don’t go to Blipfoto. To get something fixed, tell Blipfoto Support.
          </p>
          <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Contact Blipfoto Support ↗</a>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <Fragment slot="scripts">
    <script>
      import '../status/main';
    </script>
  </Fragment>
</Layout>
